stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Planned
  Planned --> Executing: tools available + budget
  Executing --> Verifying: artifact produced
  Executing --> Failed: refusal / crash / timeout
  Verifying --> Verified: gates + artifact + critic agree
  Verifying --> NeedsHuman: gate/critic disagree or taste
  Verifying --> Unverified: missing evidence
  Verifying --> Failed: gate fail / source mutation
  NeedsHuman --> Verified: human approves
  NeedsHuman --> Failed: human rejects
  Unverified --> Executing: evidence repaired
  Verified --> Archived: episode closed
  Failed --> Archived: evidence preserved
  Verified --> Candidate: reflection + evidence
  Candidate --> Active: ≥3 independent + Wilson + regression + human
  Candidate --> Rejected: insufficient evidence
  Active --> RolledBack: regression / drift
  Active --> Superseded: new version
  RolledBack --> Archived
  Superseded --> Archived
  Archived --> [*]
